[[Captain Osric]] is an officer in the [[Ascalon Vanguard]] and a friend of [[Prince Rurik]]. He sets [[quest]]s for newer members of the Vanguard. At his command post in Yak's Bend, he also [[Skill trainer|teaches skills]].

